  <!-- This project is SDK-style (Microsoft.NET.Sdk.Web), so wwwroot content is globbed
       automatically. It used to carry 3,591 explicit Include entries for the vendored
       gentelella theme; 3,544 of them already pointed at files that were not on disk. Explicit
       Content items for missing files hard-fail `dotnet publish` with MSB3030, which is why the
       parsleyjs entries in particular had to be commented out to keep the Portal image
       buildable. All of them were removed with the theme prune. The glob ships the retained
       assets, verified by publishing and confirming all 21 view-referenced files land in
       wwwroot/gentelella-master.
  -->

